21fb2aa  cli/internal/jsts/ext_test.go:15  WARNING  The test `TestExtensions_mutationIsolation` is flawed because it mutates `got` (a copy) but then compares a *new* copy (`again`) against `original` (another copy). Since `Extensions()` returns a fresh clone every time, `again` and `original` will always be equal regardless of whether the internal state was mutated. The test fails to verify that the internal `extensions` slice is protected from mutation. To properly test isolation, the test should verify that the internal state is unchanged, or it should rely on the fact that `IsExt` uses the internal slice (which the test does, but the `slices.Equal` check is redundant and misleading).
